Fixed. 

**Bug:** `src/sim.ts:43` — `advanceTurn` grew population when `foodSurplus >= 0`, so a settlement breaking even on food (surplus exactly `0`) still grew by 1 each turn.

**Fix:** Changed the condition to `foodSurplus > 0`, so population only grows on a genuine surplus, not mere break-even.

**Verified:** `npm run test` (4 tests pass) and `npm run typecheck` both clean. No `advanceTurn` test existed, so I left the test suite as-is — worth adding one covering the break-even case if you want regression protection.


